{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3cf7b870-f90a-8115-9dd8-a3575e5dc0cd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T11:16:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hi. Sorry, I'm whispering. Somebody's sleeping in the next room. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can, a little faint. Go ahead, hon, I'll listen close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm calling about the Christmas tree pickup. Mine's still out at the curb. They didn't take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "79 Ruggles Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "79 Ruggles. And when did you put it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last week, before the holiday. Trash day. And this is the second miss in a row. The week before, they skipped it too. [pause] I sell insurance, so I'm sorry, I know how to get around the phone menu. I pressed the right buttons to get a person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No apology needed, it worked. So the tree's been out there two pickups now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Two. Same spot by the mailbox, no bag on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, no bag is right. Trees go out loose. Sometimes the crews skip them if they're blocked by a snowbank or a parked car, but I'll put in a request for a pickup at 79 Ruggles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing's blocking it. It's right there on the grass strip. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'll note that. Do you want a call back, or just have them pick it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just pick it up. But if you need me, it's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0175. I'll send this over to the collection supervisor today. Next regular pickup for you should be this week, so leave it where it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. This week. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Go let your person sleep. Happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy New Year. Bye."
    }
  ],
